{"created": "2026-09-04T10:24:08.345162+00:00", "modified": "2026-09-04T13:34:43.379097+00:00", "id": 22301575, "conceptrecid": "19855611", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.22301575", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.19855611", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22301575", "metadata": {"title": "BMS alarm timeseries with periodicity labels", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.22301575", "publication_date": "2026-09-04", "description": "<h3><strong>Overview</strong></h3>\n<p>This dataset contains timestamped alarm events data collected from 22 Building Management Systems (BMS) from 9 countries (mostly european) and 7 market segments (Education, Healthcare, Transport, &hellip;) over a period of 1 month. The dataset contains 321 distinct alarm timeseries with binary events (alarm/reset), annotated with periodicity labels. The 321 series are split in predefined train/test sets for convenience. Training set data corresponds to May 2024 while Test set is from Jan-Feb 2026.</p>\n<p>For a complete description please refer to the <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.dib.2026.113193\" rel=\"noopener\">associated data paper</a>.&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>Citing</strong></h3>\n<p>To cite this dataset please use :</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; M. Verdi&egrave;re, S. Mari&eacute; , P. Knecht, \"An annotated dataset of Building Management System periodic alarms\"<em>,&nbsp;<br></em>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Data in Brief, 2026, 113193, ISSN 2352-3409, doi: <a class=\"anchor doi anchor-primary\" title=\"Persistent link using digital object identifier\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.dib.2026.113193\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><span class=\"anchor-text-container\"><span class=\"anchor-text\">10.1016/j.dib.2026.113193</span></span></a></p>\n<p>In addition, you may also wish to refer to our CoDiT paper where the dataset was first used :</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; S. Mari&eacute;, M. Verdi&egrave;re, P. Knecht, P. Dake and B. Norman, \"Efficient periodicity detection in irregular alarm <br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; event time series: application to building management system alarms\", in <em>12th International Conference<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; on Control, Decision and Information Technologies (CoDIT)</em>, Bari, Italy, 2026, pp. 616-621, <br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; doi: <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1109/CoDIT70676.2026.11630952\">10.1109/CoDIT70676.2026.11630952</a></p>\n<h3><strong>Associated github repository</strong></h3>\n<p>For any issue or discussion concerning this dataset, please open a github issue in <a href=\"https://github.com/industrial-alarms-datasets/bms-alarm-timeseries-periodic\">bms-alarm-timeseries-periodic (github)</a>. You can also find there a notebook example to reproduce the figures from the paper.</p>\n<h3><strong>Changelog</strong></h3>\n<p><strong>1.0.1 - 2026-09-04</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Added '<em>DSPub237_rejected_ambiguous.parquet</em>' containing series rejected as \"ambiguous\" in the labelling process, as suggested by one of the Data in Brief Journal Paper reviewers.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>1.0.0 - 2026-04-28</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>First dataset publication with 4 files.</li>\n</ul>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Verdi\u00e8re, Mathias", "affiliation": "Schneider Electric (France)", "orcid": "0009-0009-4894-7926"}, {"name": "Knecht, Pablo", "affiliation": "Schneider Electric (France)", "orcid": "0009-0008-3361-1832"}, {"name": "Mari\u00e9, Sylvain", "affiliation": "Schneider Electric (France)", "orcid": "0000-0002-5929-1047"}], "contributors": [{"name": "Agren, Andreas", "affiliation": "Schneider Electric (Sweden)", "type": "RelatedPerson"}, {"name": "Hammar, Andreas", "affiliation": "Schneider Electric (Sweden)", "type": "RelatedPerson"}, {"name": "Kearns, Michael", "affiliation": "Schneider Electric (USA)", "type": "RelatedPerson"}, {"name": "Norman, Benjamin", "affiliation": "Schneider Electric (USA)", "type": "ProjectMember"}], "keywords": ["timeseries", "alarm", "event", "sequence", "non-uniform", "sampling", "binary", "categorical", "annotated", "state", "Discrete Event System", "BMS", "Industrial", "SCADA"], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "10.48550/arXiv.2512.01440", "relation": "continues", "resource_type": "publication-conferenceproceeding", "scheme": "doi"}, {"identifier": "10.1016/j.dib.2026.113193", "relation": "isDocumentedBy", "resource_type": "publication-article", "scheme": "doi"}, {"identifier": "10.1109/CoDIT70676.2026.11630952", "relation": "isCitedBy", "resource_type": "publication-conferenceproceeding", "scheme": "doi"}], "dates": [{"type": "collected", "description": "Training dataset collection"}, {"type": "collected", "description": "Test dataset collection"}], "version": "1.0.1", "language": "eng", "custom": {"code:codeRepository": "https://github.com/industrial-alarms-datasets/bms-alarm-timeseries-periodic"}, "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "communities": [{"id": "industrial-alarms-datasets"}], "relations": {"version": [{"index": 1, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "19855611"}}]}}, "title": "BMS alarm timeseries with periodicity labels", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22301575", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22301575", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22301575?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22301575", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22301575", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.22301575", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22301575/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/19855611", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/19855611", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.19855611", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.19855611", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22301575/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:2230157